# Bot1 casts Emberwilde Captain on turn 3 (becoming the monarch) and Oko, Thief of Crowns on turn 5. On turn 6 Bot2
# attacks only Oko with an Elvish Mystic: that attacks a planeswalker, not Bot1 (CR 506.2), so the second ability does not
# trigger and Bot2 keeps all its life. On turn 8 two Elvish Mystics attack, one at Oko and one at Bot1: that is one attack
# on Bot1 and one trigger (not one per creature), and the Captain deals Bot2 damage equal to the cards in its hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Forest
Emberwilde Captain
Island
Oko, Thief of Crowns
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x4
Forest x12

